# The flag's one load, with the witness of a true read that the Purged zero
# claim uses up.
purged_zero	atomics primitive	loom/GenMC
# The explicit purge's guard: Verus wants a destructor that opens no
# invariant and cannot unwind; the body is one atomic subtract.
Explicit::drop	atomics primitive	Kani	discharged (Kani: purge::kani_explicit::explicit_drop_returns)
